      <slug></slug>
      <title>RHQ: Recent and future developments in the RHQ systems monitoring and management framework</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>JBoss.org Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will give a quick intro into the RHQ systems management and monitoring system and then show recent developments like &amp;#34;Dritf&amp;#34;, the detection of changes of files and configurations, the REST api for easy access to collected data from other programming languages. Last but not least I want to point out some possible future development - especially in the area of alerting.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Ref : http://www.jboss.org/jopr&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="3421">Heiko Rupp</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>